<title>UK: Morrison, Minorco units merge quarries.</title>
<headline>Morrison, Minorco units merge quarries.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Morrison Construction Group Plc said its Morrison Quarries subsidiary reached agreement with Minorco's Tilcon to merge their quarrying activities in Scotland.</p>
<p>The activities will be grouped into a 50-50 joint venture called Caledonian Quarry Products Ltd, which will have 14 quarry locations with 32 operating units and combined annual turnover of 16 million stg.</p>
<p>The combination will provide faster and better service to customers against a backdrop of current consolidation in the British quarry products market, Morrison said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
